 of a query.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="168764">snapshot</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480967">kopje në hije</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10140_168765_480966"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A static image of a set of data, such as the records displayed as the result of a query.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="168765">shadow copy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480966">pamja e çastit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10140_168765_480967"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A static image of a set of data, such as the records displayed as the result of a query.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="168765">shadow copy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480967">kopje në hije</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10153_101934_1538564"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A build promoted for use or deployment. A release can be internal and used for further testing or external and released or deployed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="101934">release</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1538564">version</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10161_17417_1479233"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To grant a person, computer process, or device access to certain information, services or functionality.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="17417">authorize</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1479233">autorizoj</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10175_47694_1479237"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Internet utility that implements the Domain Name System. DNS servers, also called name servers, maintain databases containing the addresses and are accessed transparently to the user.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="47694">Domain Name Service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1479237">Shërbimi i emrave të domenit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10175_604846_1479237"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Internet utility that implements the Domain Name System. DNS servers, also called name servers, maintain databases containing the addresses and are accessed transparently to the user.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="604846">DNS</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1479237">Shërbimi i emrave të domenit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10179_143328_1914782"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A bar marked off in units of measure (such as inches) that is displayed across the top of the document window.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="143328">horizontal ruler</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1914782">vizore horizontale</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1018_32207_480093"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To press and release a mouse button once without moving the mouse, usually to select or deselect an item or to activate a program or program feature.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="32207">click</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480093">klikoj</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10180_131401_480744"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An image that appears as the background to a document. Generally faded and transparent, so that text can be clearly read over it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="131401">watermark</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480744">shenjë ujore</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10186_126193_2308263"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To remove oneself as a recipient on a mailing list.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="126193">unsubscribe</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2308263">anulo pajtimin</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10188_42237_480171"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A representation of concepts such as facts or instructions in a formalized manner, suitable for communication, interpretation or processing.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="42237">data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480171">të dhëna</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10189_110172_1806140"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A line that separates groups of controls (on a surface) or commands (on a menu).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="110172">separator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1806140">ndarësi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10189_722343_1806140"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A line that separates groups of controls (on a surface) or commands (on a menu).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="722343">separator bar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1806140">ndarësi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1019_36322_480125"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The degree to which a computer, an attached device, a data file, or a program can work with or understand the same commands, formats, or language as another. True compatibility means that any operational differences are invisible to people and programs alike.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="36322">compatibility</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480125">përputhshmëri</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10190_122191_480698"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A command button used in a toolbar (or status bar).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="122191">toolbar button</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480698">butoni i shiritit të veglave</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10206_718_1479240"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Any technology used to protect the interests of owners of digital content and services (such as copyright owners). Typically, authorized recipients or users must acquire a license in order to use the content.</descrip></des