r specifying, building, and documenting software and non-software systems, such as business models.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="124845">Unified Modeling Language</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2857112">UML</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11983_381857_1914929"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An email folder with associated retention, archive, or expiration policies that are applied to its contents. Organizations can facilitate policy enforcement by providing such folders for users to classify email messages.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="381857">Managed E-mail Folder</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1914929">Dosje e e-postës së menaxhuar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11985_115735_480649"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A database query and programming language widely used for accessing, querying, updating, and managing data in relational database systems.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="115735">SQL</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480649">SQL</t