, although it may perform different functions in different applications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="67530">INSERT key</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480353">tasti NDËRFUT</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12018_17045_479977"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The authentication protocol (such as CHAP, PAP, EAP etc.) used when authenticating access to resources on a network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="17045">authentication method</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="479977">metoda e vërtetimit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12018_262688_479977"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The authentication protocol (such as CHAP, PAP, EAP etc.) used when authenticating access to resources on a network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="262688">auth method</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="479977">metoda e vërtetimit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12032_74843_2768995"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A connection between one or more sending and receiving devices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="74843">line</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2768995">linjë</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12039_183955_1187122"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A card-like layout on an Outlook Contact that provides the user with the look of a real world business card.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="183955">Electronic Business Card</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1187122">Kartëvizitë elektronike</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12039_183955_481385"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A card-like layout on an Outlook Contact that provides the user with the look of a real world business card.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="183955">Electronic Business Card</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="481385">Kartëvizitë</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12039_274668_1187122"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A card-like layout on an Outlook Contact that provides the user with the look of a real world business card.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="274668">Business Card</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1187122">Kartëvizitë elektronike</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12039_274668_481385"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A card-like layout on an Outlook Contact that provides the user with the look of a real world business card.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="274668">Business Card</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="481385">Kartëvizitë</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12040_294405_481400"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In 2-D stacked bar and column charts, a line that connects the data markers in a data series and is used to emphasize the difference in measurement between each series.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="294405">series line</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="481400">vija e një serie</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1205_397999_1767157"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A contract that restricts disclosure of confidential information or proprietary knowledge.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="397999">NDA</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1767157">marrëveshje konfidencialiteti</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1205_85315_1767157"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A contract that restricts disclosure of confidential information or proprietary knowledge.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="85315">non-disclosure agreement</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1767157">marrëveshje konfidencialiteti</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12055_235062_481201"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A wizard that helps the user to adjust their speakers for the best sound by running automatic calibration tests for levels, delay, and frequency response.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="235062">Speaker Calibration wizard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="481201">Eksperti i kalibrimit të altoparlantit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12063_38186_2918004"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In hardware, a coupler used to join cables or to join a cable to a device (for example, an RS-232-C connector used to join a modem cable to a computer). Most connector types are available in one of two genders--male or female. A male connector is characterized by one or more exposed pins; a female connector is characterized by one or more receptacles--sockets or jacks-- designed to accept the pins on the male connector.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="38186">connector</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2918004">konektor</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12065_235429_1538583"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A report that summarizes the status of an account, including current balance and recent activities.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="235429">statement</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1538583">deklarim</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12068_27187_480047"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A marketing program designed to accomplish a specific result, such as introducing a new product or increasing market share.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="27187">campaign</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480047">fushatë</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12068_27187_481732"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A marketing program designed to accomplish a specific result, such as introducing a new product or increasing market share.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="27187">campaign</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="481732">fushatë reklamimi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12068_335551_480047"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A marketing program designed to accomplish a specific result, such as introducing a new product or increasing market share.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="335551">marketing campaign</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480047">fushatë</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12068_335551_481732"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A marketing program designed to accomplish a specific result, such as introducing a new product or increasing market share.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="335551">marketing campaign</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="481732">fushatë reklamimi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12069_150202_480904"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The pairing of two or more actions that are performed together as a single action; the action succeeds or fails as a whole.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="150202">transaction</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480904">transaksion</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12100_338599_1834932"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To temporarily suspend an active phone call.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="338599">hold</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1834932">vë në pritje</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12103_2488684_2717623"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A trojan that records user activity, such as keystrokes, and that can send this information to an attacker using email or other methods.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2488684">key logger</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2717623">regjistruesi i tasteve</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12103_297183_2717623"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A trojan that records user activity, such as keystrokes, and that can send this information to an attacker using email or other methods.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="297183">keylogger</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2717623">regjistruesi i tasteve</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12106_65506_480346"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To displace the left or right edge of a text item, such as a block or a line, relative to the margin or to another text item.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="65506">indent</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480346">dhëmbëzoj</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12108_140776_1914764"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">For automatic subtotals and worksheet outlines, the subtotal rows or columns that are totaled by summary data. Detail data is typically adjacent to and either above or to the left of the summary data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="140776">detail data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1914764">të dhënat e detajit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12125_2524826_1914698"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An operation that retrieves rows from multiple source tables by comparing the values from columns shared between the source tables. An inner join excludes rows from a source table that have no matching rows in the other source tables.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2524826">inner</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1914698">bashkim i brendshëm</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12125_67181_1914698"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An operation that retrieves rows from multiple source tables by comparing the values from columns shared between the source tables. An inner join excludes rows from a source table that have no matching rows in the other source tables.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="67181">inner join</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1914698">bashkim i brendshëm</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12133_460782_1914945"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An Office feature that allows users to create professional looking information graphics quickly and easily.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="460782">SmartArt</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1914945">SmartArt</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12133_545625_1914945"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An Office feature that allows users to create professional looking information graphics quickly and easily.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="545625">SmartArt graphics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1914945">SmartArt</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12141_56316_1914692"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Two arrows in shape of a cross, with two heads each pointing in opposite directions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="56316">four-headed arrow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1914692">shigjetë katërkokëshe</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12144_237193_1463793"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To place a file or project back in a source repository. This releases the lock for editing and enables other users to view the updated file or check out the file.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="237193">check in</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1463793">fut në bashkësi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12146_227660_481096"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The practice of recording, classifying, summarizing, and reporting the financial consequences of accounting events.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="227660">accounting</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="481096">llogaritje</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12159_98936_1806136"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The processor in an imagesetter or desktop printer that interprets the commands sent by a printer driver and converts them to a raster or bitmap grid to mark the paper or film.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="98936">Raster Image Processor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1806136">RIP</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12159_98937_1806136"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The processor in an imagesetter or desktop printer that interprets the commands sent by a printer driver and converts them to a raster or bitmap grid to mark the paper or film.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="98937">RIP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1806136">RIP</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1216_1505033_3114888"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A central repository that stores operations data for long periods of time and is a core component of business intelligence.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1505033">data warehouse database</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3114888">depo të dhënash</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1216_43204_3114888"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A central repository that stores operations data for long periods of time and is a core component of business intelligence.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="43204">data warehouse</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3114888">depo të dhënash</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1216_43205_3114888"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A central repository that stores operations data for long periods of time and is a core component of business intelligence.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="43205">Data Warehouse</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3114888">depo të dhënash</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12163_35000_2768552"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The extension of the Component Object Model programming architecture that includes a run-time or execution environment and extensible services, including transaction services, security, load balancing, and automatic memory management.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="35000">COM+</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2768552">Shërbimet e përbërësve</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12163_35001_2768552"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The extension of the Component Object Model programming architecture that includes a run-time or execution environment and extensible services, including transaction services, security, load balancing, and automatic memory management.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="35001">Component Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2768552">Shërbimet e përbërësve</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12163_35002_2768552"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The extension of the Component Object Model programming architecture that includes a run-time or execution environment and extensible services, including transaction services, security, load balancing, and automatic memory management.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="35002">Microsoft Component Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2768552">Shërbimet e përbërësve</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1217_3131_479881"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An overlapped window used for dialog boxes, message boxes, and other temporary windows that appear outside an application's primary window.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3131">pop-up window</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="479881">dritare kërcyese</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12171_151583_480909"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process in which a consumer enters information, such as an email address, to acquire a license.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="151583">registration</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480909">regjistrim</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12173_252122_1914916"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A combination of table formatting options identified by a style name.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="252122">table style</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1914916">stili i tabelës</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12174_71139_480374"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Repeated execution of one or more statements or instructions. Statements or instructions so executed are said to be in a loop.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="71139">iteration</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480374">përsëritje</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12175_11516_2291097"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The text string that appears in place of an image when a Web page is loading, when graphics are not being displayed, or when users pause on the image itself with their mouse.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="11516">alt text</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2291097">tekst alternativ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12175_749381_2291097"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The text string that appears in place of an image when a Web page is loading, when graphics are not being displayed, or when users pause on the image itself with their mouse.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="749381">alternative text</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="g