ed by banks internationally to facilitate credit transfers across national/regional borders.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="228490">IBAN</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2003491">IBAN</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12477_308336_481492"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An area of the window that displays a limited view of search results or other content.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="308336">preview pane</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="481492">paneli i paraafishimit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12479_157172_2717625"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A program that collects information, such as the web sites a user visits, without adequate consent and installation may be without prominent notice or without the user’s knowledge.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="157172">spyware</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2717625">softuer spiun</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelec