the message. Mail-enabled universal distribution groups cannot be used to assign permissions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="397178">mail-enabled universal distribution group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2291301">grupi i shpërndarjes universale që mbështet postën</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14219_310257_481509"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Windows technology that protects OS resources (files, folders registry keys) and prevents applications and administrators from making changes to a computer's resources in an arbitrary way.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="310257">System Protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="481509">Mbrojtja e sistemit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14232_231970_481112"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A chart that provides interactive analysis of data, like a PivotTable report. You can change views of data, see different levels of detail, or reorganize the chart layout by dragging fields and by showing or hiding items in fields.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="231970">PivotChart report</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singula