entation where the long dimension of a rectangular area (for example, screen, photo, or paper) is horizontal.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="73296">landscape</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480394">për së gjeri</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14726_110688_1187152"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A number assigned to a specific inventory item to identify it and differentiate it from similar items with the same item number.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="110688">serial number</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1187152">numër serie</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14727_168754_1806141"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A logical network connection between two entities such as a user or computer, that has a defined lifetime and associated state, and that might involve multiple physical connections.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="168754">session</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1806141">sesioni</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfS