 that helps organizations to reduce the risks that are associated with email and other communications. MRM makes it easier to keep messages that are needed to comply with company policy, government regulations, or legal needs, and to remove content that has no legal or business value.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="397204">messaging records management</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2291334">MRM</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15332_397205_2291316"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Records management technology in Exchange 2007 that helps organizations to reduce the risks that are associated with email and other communications. MRM makes it easier to keep messages that are needed to comply with company policy, government regulations, or legal needs, and to remove content that has no legal or business value.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="397205">MRM</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2291316">menaxhimi i regjistrimeve të mesazhimit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15332_397205_2291334"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Records management technology in Exchange 2007 that helps organizations to reduce the risks that are associated with email and other communications. MRM makes it easier to keep messages that are needed to comply with company policy, government regulations, or legal needs, and to remove content that has no legal or business value.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="397205">MRM</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2291334">MRM</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15335_104365_2246852"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To copy files from a backup storage device to their normal location, especially if the files are being copied to replace files that were accidentally lost or deleted.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="104365">restore</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2246852">rikthej</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1534_94749_480564"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A key on IBM PC and compatible keyboards that normally causes the computer to send a character-based “picture” of the screen contents to the printer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="94749">PRINT SCREEN key</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480564">tasti PRINT SCREEN</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15350_134128_480758"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An application for creating and manipulating text-based documents.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="134128">word processor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480758">përpunuesi i fjalëve</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15359_234913_481190"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The visual experience of the premium Windows Vista editions. Windows Aero builds on the Basic and Standard user experiences to offer customers our best-designed, highest-performing desktop environment. A noticeable element of the new Windows Aero experience is the professional-looking, transparent glass design, which creates an open, lightweight environment but more importantly enables users to focus on their content rather than the interface.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234913">Aero</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="481190">Aero</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected<