p type="definition">The symbol or character used to indicate that a word, phrase, symbol, or design is a registered trademark.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="319155">REGISTERED SIGN</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="481650">simboli i markave të registruara</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15814_140706_1187161"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A window that shows the design of these database objects - tables, queries, forms, reports, macros, and data access pages. In Design view, you can create new database objects and modify the design of existing ones.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="140706">Design view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1187161">Pamja e dizajnit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15817_308348_481500"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A label for a geographic selection.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="308348">State/Region</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="481500">Shteti/Rajoni</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15818_234305_481152"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A form component, such as a template part or ActiveX control, that isn't included with InfoPath by default. Form designers can add or remove custom controls by using the Controls task pane.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234305">custom control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="481152">kontroll i përshtatur</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15834_83662_480478"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An area of an application window that enables the user to navigate quickly to different parts of the program.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="83662">navigation pane</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480478">Paneli i navigimit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15842_210445_1463805"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A function that verifies the technology is compatible with the target browser.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="210445">compatibility checker</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1463805">kontrolluesi i përputhshmërisë</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15847_51369_1187162"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of inputting information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="51369">entry</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1187162">futje</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15850_1056049_2483141"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A list of items that a customer has selected to purchase from a commerce Web site. It is usually compiled into a file and sometimes visually represented by a shopping basket, shopping cart, or other container used when shopping.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1056049">shopping cart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2483141">karrocë</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15850_1056053_2483141"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A list of items that a customer has selected to purchase from a commerce Web site. It is usually compiled into a file and sometimes visually represented by a shopping basket, shopping cart, or other container used when shopping.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1056053">cart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2483141">karrocë</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15850_188099_2483141"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A list of items that a customer has selected to purchase from a commerce Web site. It is usually compiled into a file and sometimes visually represented by a shopping basket, shopping cart, or other container used when shopping.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="188099">basket</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2483141">karrocë</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15855_148370_1188528"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A character you choose to indicate where you want text to separate when you convert a table to text, or where you want new rows or columns to begin when you convert text to a table.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="148370">separator character</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1188528">karakter ndarës</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15861_87814_2595248"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Running low on memory.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="87814">out of memory</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adverb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2595248">memorie e pamjaftueshme</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adverb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15886_319136_480328"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The ‐ character, used to break a word between syllables at the end of a line or to separate the parts of a compound word.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="319136">HYPHEN</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480328">vijë ndarëse</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15886_63086_480328"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The ‐ character, used to break a word between syllables at the end of a line or to separate the parts of a compound word.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="63086">hyphen</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480328">vijë ndarëse</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15888_62684_3041735"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A color model used in some graphics programs to define a color by three values: Hue, the color itself; Saturation, the purity of the color; and Value, the lightness or darkness of a color.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="62684">HSV</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3041735">HSV</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15888_757192_3041735"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A color model used in some graphics programs to define a color by three values: Hue, the color itself; Saturation, the purity of the color; and Value, the lightness or darkness of a color.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="757192">hue-saturation-value</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3041735">HSV</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15904_138795_480799"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A range of colors in which each color gradually blends into the next one. For example, a blue ramp gradually blends hues of blue from pure black to pure blue.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="138795">color ramp</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480799">devijimi i ngjyrës</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15921_140658_1187163"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A file that contains the styles in a presentation, including the type and size of bullets and fonts; placeholder sizes and positions; background design and fill; color schemes; and a slide master and optional title master.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="140658">design template</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1187163">shablloni i dizajnit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15926_234817_481182"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An item on the Control Panel that provides user a comprehensive view over all roamed content, as well as ability to check on the synchronization progress of individual items.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234817">Sync Center</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="481182">Qendra e sinkronizimit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15928_140842_1914766"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An animation enhancement that lets you apply effects to a diagram piece by piece; for example, from top to bottom of a pyramid diagram.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="140842">diagram effect option</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1914766">opsioni i efektit të diagramit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1593_108356_480611"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A component of a scroll bar that indicates the relative position (and optionally the proportion) of the visible information relative to the entire amount of information. The user can drag the scroll box to view areas of information not currently visible.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="108356">scroll box</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="48