ar</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17846_650206_1806095"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In the Charts And Graphs template, a control handle on the Line Graph shape that you can drag to change the values in the graph.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650206">data point</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1806095">pika e të dhënave</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17851_650211_1914999"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A character that is used to separate the day, month, and year when date values are formatted. The characters are determined by system settings or by the Format function.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650211">date separator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1914999">ndarësi i datës</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17854_650214_1188554"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The font that a program uses by default to display text.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650214">default font</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term