r software) to translate text from one human language to another.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1585924">automated translation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2828410">përkthim automatik</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20749_2825755_2828410"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of using a “machine” (in most cases computer software) to translate text from one human language to another.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2825755">automatic translation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2828410">përkthim automatik</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20749_747350_2828410"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of using a “machine” (in most cases computer software) to translate text from one human language to another.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="747350">machine translation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2828410">përkthim automatik</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20752_747355_1188609"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A pencil tool that works with texture and simulates a real life pencil in stroke.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="747355">natural pencil</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1188609">laps natyral</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20754_747357_1188610"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Windows feature that enables users to easily roll back their PC to an earlier good state while keeping their data safe.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="747357">System Recovery</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1188610">Rikuperimi i sistemit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2077_149214_1188364"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A view on a calendar that displays items such as meetings and events from left to right on a time scale and that can incorporate items from multiple calendars.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="149214">timeline</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1188364">vija kohore</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20781_747562_2842398"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In a call queue, a method of sending calls to agents whereby incoming calls ring all call agents one by one, from the beginning of the call agent list. If an agent dismisses or does not pick up a call, the call will ring the next agent and will try all agents until it is picked up or times out.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="747562">serial routing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2842398">rrugëzim serie</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20803_3193169_1188611"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A process by which multiple authors edit a shared document simultaneously, or collaborate effectively even when they are not online at the same time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3193169">coauthoring</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1188611">bashkautorësi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><ter