 in order to categorize information for easy retrieval and sorting.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="748513">Categories</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1188616">Kategoritë</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20865_748916_1576613"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature in Internet Explorer that helps detect phishing websites and can help protect you from installing malicious software or malware.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="748916">SmartScreen Filter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1576613">Filtri i SmartScreen</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20867_2676671_2677497"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows the user to fill cells with data that follows a pattern or that is based on data in other cells.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2676671">AutoFill</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2677497">Vetëmbushje</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNot