l item in the Windows Explorer preview pane.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="761307">previewer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1806132">paraafishuesi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20981_761308_1806132"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A handler that displays a lightweight, read-only preview of a file’s contents without launching the application associated with the file. For example, a preview handler displays a Shell item in the Windows Explorer preview pane.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="761308">preview handler</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1806132">paraafishuesi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20983_761626_1834994"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A call that originates from your mobile device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="761626">outgoing call</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1834994">thirrjet dalëse</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20984_761629_1519453"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collaborative action, such as sharing, calendar sharing, or using a whiteboard.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="761629">activity</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1519453">aktivitet</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2099_2397421_3114887"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A subset of the contents of a data warehouse that tends to contain data focused at the department level, or on a specific business area.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2397421">DataMart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3114887">nëndepo të dhënash</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2099_418571_3114887"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A subset of the contents of a data warehouse that tends to contain data focused at the department level, or on a specific business area.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="418571">data mart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3114887">nëndepo të dhënash</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20992_762951_1519536"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An email that a customer does not want delivered to their inbox, including spam and phishing messages (identified by the mail service) and messages from blocked senders and domains.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="762951">junk e-mail</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1519536">të padëshiruara</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20992_762956_1519536"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An email that a customer does not want delivered to their inbox, including spam and phishing messages (identified by the mail service) and messages from blocked senders and domains.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="762956">junk</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1519536">të padëshiruara</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20998_763011_1372780"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of colors and background images that lets users change the appearance of Windows Live pages. The theme is common to all pages, except for group, event, and space pages, which may each have their own theme.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="763011">theme</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1372780">temë</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20999_763132_1519563"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To copy something from a computer to a location online, such as a photo album or a blog post.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="763132">publish</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1519563">publikoj</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21000_763151_1519560"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Parental consent for a child to use a service, view a website, or communicate with a person.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="763151">permission</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1519560">leje</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><term