e one locale support and that provides all the hardware display components in order for your device information to be shown in the Control Panel.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="782325">device metadata package</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1188707">paketa e meta-të dhënave të pajisjes</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21990_782330_1188708"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To uninstall all software on a computer and reinstall a new Windows image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="782330">re-image</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1188708">përtërij</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21994_782341_1188709"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An easy-to-use troubleshooter that helps find and fix program compatibility issues.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="782341">Program Compatibility troubleshooter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1188709">Zgjidhësi i problemeve të përputhshmërisë së programit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="pa