uesi i ndryshimeve</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31787_1623957_1915290"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">One of the distinct pieces that make up a chart, such as a title, axis, legend, trendline, or error bar.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1623957">chart element</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1915290">element grafiku</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31788_1623958_1915291"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A visual indicator that denotes the presence of a comment and opens the comment when clicked.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1623958">comment hint</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1915291">treguesi i komenteve</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31789_1623959_1915292"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A pane beside the document that displays all comments made in the document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1623959">Comments pane</term><termNote type="pa