y operator can call the person on their phone, so that the emergency operator can call back or determine where the user is at.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1628748">Emergency Callback Mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1834898">Modaliteti i Rithirrjes së Urgjencës</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31952_1628750_1834907"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The pictures that you can select to appear in the animated Pictures tile on Start, and in the Photos hub.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1628750">favorites</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1834907">të preferuara</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31953_1628751_1834909"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection title for items emphasized by the Store through placement on the site.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1628751">Featured</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1834909">Të spikatura</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</ter