, scenario-focused content and services into an Office application.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2285299">Office add-in</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2300868">Shtesa e Office-it</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32183_1638272_1688144"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A user interface element that provides access to sharing files and info with other apps.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1638272">Share charm</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1688144">simboli i Bashkëndarjes</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32184_1638273_1640141"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A user interface element that provides access to search in apps or on the PC.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1638273">Search charm</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1640141">simboli i Kërkimit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termG