otSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2067991">aktivizim kompjuteri i përbashkët</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35685_2052902_2498152"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A licensing mode that enables Office 365 subscribers to access their account from different computers and that allows multiple users belonging to the same subscription to log in and use their account from the same computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2052902">shared computer activation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2498152">SCA</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35685_2488791_2067991"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A licensing mode that enables Office 365 subscribers to access their account from different computers and that allows multiple users belonging to the same subscription to log in and use their account from the same computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2488791">SCA</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2067991">aktivizim kompjuteri i përbashkët</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">N