lows the user to capture multiple images simultaneously with different focus settings.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2144340">Lumia Refocus</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2242118">Lumia Refocus</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37583_2144341_2242120"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app for capturing, editing, and sharing photos of oneself that can be automatically enhanced with various effects.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2144341">Lumia Selfie</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2242120">Lumia Selfie</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37584_2144342_2334198"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A photo that one has taken of oneself, normally using a smartphone or a digital camera, that is planned to be uploaded to a social media website.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2144342">selfie</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2334198">selfi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote 