</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38975_2264866_2265995"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The hidden utility that works in the background to connect Windows features to a 3rd party service.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2264866">App connector</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2265995">Lidhësi i aplikacioneve</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38980_2267302_2271079"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of REST APIs that allows app developers unified access to entities and relationships from Microsoft and Office 365 services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2267302">Microsoft Graph</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2271079">Grafi i Microsoft</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38980_2267302_2358353"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of REST APIs that allows app developers unified access to entities and relationships from Microsoft and Office 365 services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2267302">Microsoft Graph</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote