 in the project.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2856027">Agile Scrum</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2572076">Scrum</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39791_2856027_2857165"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An iterative and incremental agile software development methodology for managing product development defining "a flexible, holistic product development strategy where a development team works as a unit to reach a common goal", challenges assumptions of the "traditional, sequential approach" to product development, and enabling teams to self-organize by encouraging physical co-location or close online collaboration of all team members, as well as daily face-to-face communication among all team members and disciplines in the project.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2856027">Agile Scrum</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2857165">Agile Scrum</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3980_37784_480138"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To acknowledge an action or the value of some data (e.g. password) by definite assurance.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="37784">confirm</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480138">konfirmoj</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39836_2309204_2652888"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A software development approach where developers must first write a test that fails before they write the code to make the test succeed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2309204">TDD</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2652888">zhvillim i bazuar në test</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39836_2309244_2652888"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A software development approach where developers must first write a test that fails before they write the code to make the test succeed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2309244">test-driven development</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2652888">zhvillim i bazuar në test</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39847_2310171_2335609"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office service that uses the Microsoft Graph to give personalized insight to users around content and people based on who they interact with in their company and what content their colleagues are viewing, restricted by permissions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2310171">Delve</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2335609">Delve</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39847_2407977_2335609"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office service that uses the Microsoft Graph to give personalized insight to users around content and people based on who they interact with in their company and what content their colleagues are viewing, restricted by permissions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2407977">Microsoft Delve</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2335609">Delve</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39848_2384090_2385532"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Facebook mobile app that is built and is distributed by Microsoft.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2384090">Facebook for Windows Phone 8.1</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2385532">Facebook për Windows Phone 8.1</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3985_113531_480635"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A handle that supports sizing an object.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="113531">sizing handle</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480635">doreza e përmasimit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39850_2312644_2329723"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The UI element in Outlook that when clicked will identify and display email where a user has been explicitly mentioned via the @ symbol in either the email subject or body.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312644">Mentions</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2329723">Përmendje</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39851_2312649_2322067"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To remove a flag.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312649">unflag</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322067">hiq flamurin</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39852_2312651_2322064"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A badge for OneNote which when clicked lets users take notes quickly while using any app on the Android platform.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312651">OneNote badge</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322064">Stema e OneNote</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39853_2312652_2322058"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The act of going to different places on the Internet, on a particular Web site, in a database, etc. in order to find what you want.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312652">navigation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322058">navigim</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39856_2312654_2322065"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook feature that allows users to sort and display email based on predefined criteria.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312654">Quick Filter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322065">Filtrim i shpejtë</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39856_2312654_2360953"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook feature that allows users to sort and display email based on predefined criteria.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312654">Quick Filter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2360953">Filtra të shpejtë për listën e mesazheve</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39856_2357846_2322065"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook feature that allows users to sort and display email based on predefined criteria.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2357846">Quick Filters for message list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322065">Filtrim i shpejtë</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39856_2357846_2360953"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook feature that allows users to sort and display email based on predefined criteria.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2357846">Quick Filters for message list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2360953">Filtra të shpejtë për listën e mesazheve</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39857_2312655_2322056"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook feature that intelligently presorts email across all email accounts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312655">Focused Inbox</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322056">Kutia mbërritëse e fokusuar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39858_2312656_2322068"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The menu selection that allows users to move emails from the focused inbox into the Other category.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312656">Move to Non-Focused Inbox</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322068">Zhvendos te kutia mbërritëse e pafokusuar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39864_2322624_2326382"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The wireless personal area network technology, launched in 2010 and marketed as Bluetooth Smart, used for transmitting data over distances as much as 100 meters. Cost and power consumption are low while maintaining a communication range similar to Bluetooth BR/EDR, the other widely-used version of Bluetooth</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322624">Bluetooth Smart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2326382">Bluetooth Smart</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39866_2315181_2321547"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Bluetooth Low Energy device that sends static information, such as location or ID, to devices within its area.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2315181">beacon</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321547">sinjalizues</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3987_141789_1914771"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A placeholder text that included the field character, field type, and instructions, and that that shows where specified information from a data source will appear such that the elements in a field that generate a field's result.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="141789">field code</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1914771">kodi i fushës</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39877_2315966_2321578"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature for maps of the interior of some public places, such as the businesses inside a mall, or the gates, businesses, and other services inside an airport.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2315966">venue map</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321578">harta e objektit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39878_2316274_2321573"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Of, pertaining to, or characteristic of apps or services made available in an enterprise to help with particular business and process needs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2316274">line-of-business</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321573">i linjës së biznesit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39878_2316275_2321573"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Of, pertaining to, or characteristic of apps or services made available in an enterprise to help with particular business and process needs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2316275">LOB</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321573">i linjës së biznesit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39880_2320100_2323257"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app for PC and Surface Hub that helps you connect a phone or PC to the Surface Hub display, or to another PC. On Surface Hub, it also allows you to switch between devices that are connected to the Surface Hub.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2320100">Connect</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></lan