aticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40121_2331937_2340890"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An automatically generated filter list in Wunderlist (e.g. Today, Week, Assigned to me, Starred, All, and Completed Smart List) that shows all tasks from across all your task lists that meet the specific criteria.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331937">smart list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340890">lista inteligjente</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40122_2331938_2340893"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Mac OS X specific part of the app that allows Wunderlist to receive push notifications on the Mac.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331938">Wunderlist Helper</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340893">Ndihmësi i Wunderlist</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40123_2331939_2340889"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Wunderlist feature that allows users to enter due dates for a task as text (e.g. next Sunday), automatically recognize the date, and set a due date and reminder for 