ed</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40161_2333639_2340573"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows you to tap a phone against another device to pay for a purchase using a credit or debit card enrolled in Microsoft Wallet as a method of payment.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2333639">tap to pay</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340573">trokitja për të paguar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40162_2333642_2340883"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A UI element that gives a user a view of the important email, as presorted by the Focused Inbox feature.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2333642">Focused</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340883">I(E) fokusuar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40163_2333645_2340885"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The email management approach developed by productivity expert Merlin Mann so that zero time is spent thinking about email without any of the five actions he identified.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2333645">Inbox Zero</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2340885">Kutia mbërritëse zero</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4017_397157_2291234"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A storage platform that provides a single repository for managing multiple types of unstructured information in one infrastructure. The Exchange store combines the features and functionality of the file system, the Web, and a collaboration server (such as Microsoft Exchange) through a single, URL-addressable location for storing, accessing, and managing information, as well as building and running applications. The Exchange store is also known as the Web Storage System.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="397157">Exchange store</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2291234">Dyqani i Exchange</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40220_2338748_2340568"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service designed to provide single sign-on for browser, apps, and services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2338748">Web Account Manager</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig>