e</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40537_2354519_2357163"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The phone app that helps customers transfer content from their Android phone to their Windows 10 Mobile phone. There are 2 instances of the app, one that you install on Android, and one that you install on Windows (phone only).​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354519">Move to Windows</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2357163">Kalo në Windows</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40541_2354632_2687366"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A statistical measure of the reliability of an estimate, which calculates the margin of error.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354632">confidence</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2687366">besueshmëria</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4055_21561_480012"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The smallest unit of information handled by a computer or device. One bit expresses a 1 or a 0 in a binary numeral, or a true or false logical condition. A group of 8 bits makes up a byte, which can represent many types of information, such as a letter of the alphabet, a decimal digit, or other character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="21561">bit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480012">bit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4055_21561_480013"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The smallest unit of information handled by a computer or device. One bit expresses a 1 or a 0 in a binary numeral, or a true or false logical condition. A group of 8 bits makes up a byte, which can represent many types of information, such as a letter of the alphabet, a decimal digit, or other character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="21561">bit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480013">shifër binare</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4055_21562_480012"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The smallest unit of information handled by a computer or device. One bit expresses a 1 or a 0 in a binary numeral, or a true or false logical condition. A group of 8 bits makes up a byte, which can represent many types of information, such as a letter of the alphabet, a decimal digit, or other character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="21562">binary digit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480012">bit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4055_21562_480013"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The smallest unit of information handled by a computer or device. One bit expresses a 1 or a 0 in a binary numeral, or a true or false logical condition. A group of 8 bits makes up a byte, which can represent many types of information, such as a letter of the alphabet, a decimal digit, or other character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="21562">binary digit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480013">shifër binare</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4059_124417_1914732"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A file (or component within another file) that contains Automation standard descriptions of exposed objects, properties, and methods.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="124417">type library</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1914732">biblioteka e tipave</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="406_22638_2291123"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A portion of content within an email or Internet newsgroups, that follows the header and contains the content of the message.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="22638">body</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2291123">trupi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40601_2357561_2357722"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Skype for Business PSTN Consumption billing enables customers to access PSTN features that are not available in the base PSTN Conferencing and PSTN Calling subscriptions, such as toll-free dial in for conferences, international dial out in conferences, and international dial out for PSTN Calling Domestic Plans</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2357561">Skype for Business PSTN Consumption</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2357722">Konsumi PSTN i Skype për biznesin</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40602_2357666_2359694"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An application that provides step counts, workouts, sleep quality data and a web dashboard to give insights into physical activity benefits to the user’s overall health.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2357666">Microsoft Health</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2359694">Microsoft Health</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40603_2357731_2359278"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The display technology that provides high-resolution display, touch and ink capabilities, wide-viewing angle, and more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2357731">PixelSense</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2359278">PixelSense</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40618_2392508_2517858"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Project work management app that helps a team create new plans, organize and assign work, share files, discuss team activity, and get updates on progress.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2392508">Planner</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2517858">Planner</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40618_2393978_2517858"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Project work management app that helps a team create new plans, organize and assign work, share files, discuss team activity, and get updates on progress.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2393978">Microsoft Planner</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2517858">Planner</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40619_2357847_2366967"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The drop-down menu that gives users the option of filtering messages in their inbox by “Unread” or “Flagged” items.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2357847">Quick Filters for message list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2366967">Filtra të shpejtë për listën e mesazheve</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40620_2357848_2360952"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The button that gives users the option of filtering messages in their inbox by “Unread” or “Flagged” items.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2357848">Quick Filters</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2360952">Filtra të shpejtë</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40621_2357849_2360951"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows users to tag emails by using # followed by a keyword within the message and that enables users to view all emails tagged with that keyword in their email account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2357849">Hashtags</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2360951">Thurje</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40632_2358041_2359271"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The category of apps or games that are selected based on downloads, usage, and revenue over a 7-day period and ranks them according to those metrics.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2358041">Most popular</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2359271">Më të pëlqyera</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40633_2358042_2359285"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The category for items that are in the top 1000 items based on sales.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2358042">Best selling</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2359285">Më të shiturat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40652_2358625_2359344"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The view of a particular contact within the People app that shows all your past communication, upcoming meetings, status updates, and files you share with that person. ​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2358625">Timeline</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2359344">Vija kohore</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40653_2358634_2435366"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To remove a shortcut to an application or part of an application from the Start screen (the full screen view of Start) or Start menu.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2358634">unpin from Start</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2435366">zhvendos nga Nisja</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40655_2361528_2473084"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The application that lets users sync files from OneDrive for Business or Microsoft SharePoint to their local computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2361528">OneDrive sync client</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2473084">Klienti i sinkronizimit i OneDrive</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40657_2358714_2364217"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A chart that use a map and colors to reflect characteristics specific to a particular geographical location.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2358714">map chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2364217">grafik me hartë</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40677_2359171_2364219"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The tool that allows users to import Evernote notes into OneNote.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2359171">OneNote Importer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2364219">Importues i OneNote</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40678_2359180_2364220"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The mobile app that allows users to create a group so that members can collaborate, share messages, calendar events, files, tasks, and so on.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2359180">Outlook Groups</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2364220">Outlook Groups</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4068_186296_1187028"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The integral Windows component that supports building, deploying, and running the next generation of applications and XML Web services. It provides a highly productive, standards-based, multilanguage environment for integrating existing investments with next generation applications and services, as well as the agility to solve the challenges of deployment and operation of Internet-scale applications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="186296">.NET Framework</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1187028">.NET Framework</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4068_536518_1187028"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The integral Windows component that supports building, deploying, and running the next generation of applications and XML Web services. It provides a highly productive, standards-based, multilanguage environment for integrating existing investments with next generation applications and services, as well as the agility to solve the challenges of deployment and operation of Internet-scale applications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="536518">Framework</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1187028">.NET Framework</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40683_2360130_2362628"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection title for TV shows that are in the top N% of sales.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2360130">Top-selling TV shows</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2362628">Shfaqjet televizive më të shitura</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40684_2360133_2362330"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Not containing any ads being played beforehand.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2360133">ad-free</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2362330">pa reklama</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40685_2360134_2362341"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The metadata about the song in a music album, such as genre, artist, year.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2360134">album info</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2362341">informacioni i albumit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40686_2360135_2362361"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The credits for a movie or TV show including the main actors, actresses, directors, and more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2360135">cast and crew</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2362361">aktorët dhe ekipi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40687_2360136_2362381"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To learn more information about an item in your collection.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2360136">explore</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2362381">eksploroj</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4069_359698_1806086"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A data type that stores either a 1 or 0 value. Integer values other than 1 or 0 are accepted, but they are always interpreted as 1.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="359698">bit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1806086">bit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40694_2360413_2362494"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A movie or TV show that can be watched instantly and in high definition.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2360413">instant-on HD</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2362494">HD me aktivizim të menjëhershëm</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40697_2360416_2362544"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The collection title for the music albums that are on sale in the Movie Store.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2360416">Music deals</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2362544">Promocionet e muzikës</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40698_2360417_2362563"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The category in Windows Store music section that shows the user's music in Groove Music app.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2360417">My music</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2362563">Muzika ime</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40699_2360422_2362638"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The movie or TV show label assigned to a movie or TV show that has not been rated by the Motion Picture Association of America (MPAA).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2360422">Unrated</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2362638">Pa vlerësim</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40700_2360425_2362579"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The view that shows the recent items you have played.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2360425">Recent plays</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2362579">Leximet e fundit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40701_2360426_2362606"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A pass that provides access to all current and future episodes of a TV show season, usually sold at a discount price.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2360426">season pass</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2362606">abonim sezonal</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammati