s to tasks, track progress, manage budgets, and analyze workloads.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2542481">Project</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2544976">Project</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42580_2412455_2413314"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Adobe's proprietary image format for raw files generated by digital cameras.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2412455">DNG</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2413314">DNG</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42580_2412466_2413314"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Adobe's proprietary image format for raw files generated by digital cameras.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2412466">Digital Negative</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2413314">DNG</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42581_2412468_2413319"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A visual effect that occurs when a photo is taken of a fast-moving object.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2412468">motion blur</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2413319">mjegullim i lëvizjes</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42582_2412469_2413329"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that initiates a 2, 5, or 10-second delay for taking a picture.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2412469">photo timer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2413329">kohëvonuesi i fotografisë</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42582_2905571_2413329"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that initiates a 2, 5, or 10-second delay for taking a picture.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2905571">timer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2413329">kohëvonuesi i fotografisë</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="gra