ic that shows a progression of steps in a task, process, or workflow.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2435052">bending process</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2438677">procesi i përkuljes</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42973_2435053_2438676"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A SmartArt graphic type that shows a series of pictures that wrap around in the confines of a box.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2435053">bending picture</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2438676">imazh i përkulur</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42974_2435055_2438678"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook feature that allows users to act on events such as travel reservations and package deliveries captured from email and receive reminders for them.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2435055">Events from Email</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2438678">Ngjarjet nga emaili</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNot