er Advanced Threat Protection, which helps protect against malware that uses exploits to infect devices and spread.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2520655">Exploit Protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2523555">Mbrojtja ndaj shfrytëzimit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44799_2520749_2523569"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A computer file format designed to store three-dimensional data that are described as a collection of polygons.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2520749">PLY</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2523569">PLY</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="448_93293_480551"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An input device used to control an on-screen cursor for such actions as "pressing" on-screen buttons in dialog boxes, choosing menu items, and selecting ranges of cells in spreadsheets or groups of words in a document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="93293">pointing device</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="480551">pajisje treguese</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44800_2520756_2523568"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An open file format created as a simple way to import and export geometry from different 3D applications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2520756">OBJ</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2523568">OBJ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44803_2521100_2674123"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The framework that consists of a web part and a page that provides full support for client-side SharePoint development, easy integration with SharePoint data, and support for open source tooling so that developers can use their preferred tools and technologies.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2521100">SharePoint Framework</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2674123">SPFx</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44803_2673786_2674123"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The framework that consists of a web part and a page that 