 type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44823_2524057_2575075"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A hardware accessory that allows you to take action in mixed reality. It tracks a precise position in space, allowing for fine-grained interaction with digital objects. When using a Windows Mixed Reality immersive headset, the motion controller is the primary way to take action.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2524057">motion controller</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2575075">kontrolluesi i lëvizjes</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44823_2524057_2575096"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A hardware accessory that allows you to take action in mixed reality. It tracks a precise position in space, allowing for fine-grained interaction with digital objects. When using a Windows Mixed Reality immersive headset, the motion controller is the primary way to take action.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2524057">motion controller</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2575096">kontrolluesi i lëvizjes i Windows Mixed Reality</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSe