y designed and trustworthy, and helps ensure that all software running in kernel mode, including drivers, securely allocate memory and operate as they are intended.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2610077">memory integrity</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2610987">integriteti i memories</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46344_2834959_2835110"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The desktop-only sync app for OneDrive that enables on-demand file sharing and navigation in File Explorer and that comes pre-installed on PCs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2834959">Microsoft OneDrive sync</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2835110">Sinkronizimi i Microsoft OneDrive</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46344_2834959_2835202"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The desktop-only sync app for OneDrive that enables on-demand file sharing and navigation in File Explorer and that comes pre-installed on PCs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2834959">Microsoft OneDrive sync</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="s