ural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2621115">Aksesorët e Xbox</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46540_2619582_2621101"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Xbox Live feature allowing the user to create and customize their avatars as well as purchase new avatar items like clothes, accessories and more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2619582">Xbox Avatar Editor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2621101">Redaktori i avatarit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46540_2619582_2621104"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Xbox Live feature allowing the user to create and customize their avatars as well as purchase new avatar items like clothes, accessories and more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2619582">Xbox Avatar Editor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2621104">Redaktori i avatarit të Xbox</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46540_2619583_2621101"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Xbox Live feature allowing the user to create and customize their avatars as well as purchase new avatar items like clothes, accessories and more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2619583">Avatar Editor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2621101">Redaktori i avatarit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46540_2619583_2621104"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Xbox Live feature allowing the user to create and customize their avatars as well as purchase new avatar items like clothes, accessories and more.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2619583">Avatar Editor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2621104">Redaktori i avatarit të Xbox</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46542_2619590_2619906"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The auto chat moderation tool in Mixer that looks at the context of messages people are sending and “snipes” content the user finds inappropriate before it hits their channel. Users can preview messages removed, and report inaccuracies.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2619590">Catbot</term><termNote