ntication standard developed by the FIDO Alliance which allows online services to strengthen the security of their existing password infrastructure by adding a strong second factor to sign in. The user signs in with the user name and password and then is required to present a second factor device for secure authentication.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2628468">U2F</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2634565">F2U</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46717_2628468_2634566"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The open authentication standard developed by the FIDO Alliance which allows online services to strengthen the security of their existing password infrastructure by adding a strong second factor to sign in. The user signs in with the user name and password and then is required to present a second factor device for secure authentication.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2628468">U2F</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2634566">Faktori i dytë universal</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46717_2628469_2634565"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The open authentication standard developed by the FIDO Alliance which allows on