, allowing them to schedule meetings and access recordings without needing to switch apps.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2685862">Calendar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2689897">Kalendar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="47730_2685867_2687425"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The cloud-based feature available to Office 365 and Microsoft 365 customers that manages printers on the cloud, replacing and that makes available printers visible to the users through the cloud, allowing print jobs to be submitted from any device, anywhere, to any printer available on the cloud with user access.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2685867">Universal Print</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2687425">Printim universal</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="47731_2685869_2689890"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To make the background obscure while the speaker's image remains clear during a video call or video meeting.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2685869">blur</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><lang