rosoft 365 compliance center where users can find information on how retention and sensitivity labels are being used to classify, retain, and protect their organization's content in the cloud.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2736700">Label analytics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2738401">Analitika e etiketës</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48425_2736701_2738647"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The view in the Microsoft 365 compliance center and the Microsoft 365 security center that allows admins to manage who in their organization has access to Microsoft 365 security center and is able to view content and perform tasks.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2736701">Permissions</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2738647">Lejet</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48426_2736702_2738387"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The view in the Microsoft 365 security center and Microsoft 365 compliance center that displays alerts and their related information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2736702">Alerts</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber"