s also by guests, such as parents).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2817586">video reply</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2914371">replikë</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49840_2817590_2913006"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Flipgrid view that automatically plays videos as the user scrolls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2817590">Glance view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2913006">Pamje</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49840_2817590_2913007"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Flipgrid view that automatically plays videos as the user scrolls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2817590">Glance view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2913007">Pamje e shpejtë</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49840_2817597_2913006"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><d