rip type="definition">The ability to take into account not just yourself and your teammates, but also the context that surrounds you.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2857364">situational awareness</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2858500">njohje e rrethanave</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50477_2857366_2858454"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The ability to sense the emotions of others and recognize the impact that one’s actions may have on others.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2857366">co-awareness</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2858454">bashkëndërgjegjësim</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50478_2857368_2858456"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The productive force that emerges when a team harnesses their differences, as a result of nurturing and balancing the other key team dynamics: team purpose, collective identity, awareness, inclusion, trust and vulnerability.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2857368">constructive tension</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="28584