ected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52041_2947844_2948887"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Microsoft’s 1st party PSTN calling services, currently available in 18 markets and one way to enable PSTN calling in Teams (Direct Routing and Operator Connect being the alternatives).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2947844">Teams Calling Plans</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2948887">Planet e telefonisë së Teams</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52042_2930011_2931273"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The overall telephony workload for Microsoft Teams, including the core cloud-based call control system that is used to replace traditional PBXs, and enables key calling capabilities.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2930011">Microsoft Teams Phone</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2931273">Telefoni i Microsoft Teams</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52042_2930011_2949811"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The overall telephony workload for Microsoft Teams, including the core cloud-based call control system that is used to replace traditional PBXs, and ena