nd sensitive operations in memory.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3170950">virtualization-based security enclave</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3175900">rrethim VBS</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56391_3170950_3175901"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A software-based trusted execution environment inside the address space of a host application. More technically, it is a Dynamic Link Library (DLL) loaded by a standard Windows application that secures secrets and sensitive operations in memory.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3170950">virtualization-based security enclave</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3175901">rrethim sigurie me bazë virtualizimi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56391_3170951_3175900"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A software-based trusted execution environment inside the address space of a host application. More technically, it is a Dynamic Link Library (DLL) loaded by a standard Windows application that secures secrets and sensitive operations in memory.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3170951">VBS enclave</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="gramm