 the effect of the cursor control keys and sometimes prevents the screen from scrolling. On the enhanced and Macintosh keyboards, this key is to the right of the function keys on the top row. Many modern applications ignore the Scroll Lock setting.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="108242">SCROLL LOCK key</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1186986">tasti SCROLL LOCK</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6894_318712_481615"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A statement that the text or program code contained within the item on which the notice appears is the intellectual property of Microsoft (or other entity).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="318712">copyright notice</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="481615">njoftim i të drejtës së autorit</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ALB</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6904_108595_1519568"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To try to locate something (a file, a folder, a computer, a text).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="108595">search</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="sq"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1519568">kërkoj